{"availability":"available","full":"ppiiyo/EIDOS","name":"EIDOS","description":"Real-Time Semantic Affinity Engine for Marketplaces, Digital Libraries & Streaming Platforms.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-16T19:59:06Z","updated":"2026-10-11T07:27:02Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://eidos-demo.vercel.app/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T07:27:08.249Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T07:27:08.249Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T07:27:08.249Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T07:27:08.249Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Real-Time Semantic Affinity Engine for Marketplaces, Digital Libraries & Streaming Platforms. Eliminates cold-start item starvation via 384-dimensional dense vector embeddings and Shannon entropy diversity re-ranking. Zero external cloud lock-in. 100% self-hostable.","Live Demo • Quickstart Guide • REST API Reference • Architecture • Benchmarks","EIDOS is an open-source, production-grade semantic recommendation and vector search engine. Rather than relying on historical transaction logs, user clicks, or brittle lexical keyword matching, EIDOS computes conceptual affinities in 384-dimensional vector space using transformer models (all-MiniLM-L6-v2)."],"features":["Cold-Start Elimination: New products, articles, or songs are instantly indexed and discoverable upon ingestion.","Dual Execution Modes: Runs in-browser via WebAssembly (Transformers.js) or as a containerized Fastify microservice.","Diversity Balancing: Employs Maximum Marginal Relevance (MMR) and Shannon entropy heuristics to prevent narrow recommendation echo-chambers.","Zero Cloud Lock-in: 100% self-hostable in Docker, Kubernetes, Fly.io, or bare metal.","Все параметры конфигурируемы через env (AILALPHA, AILBETA, AILGAMMA, AILDELTA, AILEPSILON, AILZETA, AILETA, AILSMMRLAMBDA, AILSMMRSAMPLESIZE, AILSMMRTEMPERATU